'''Fiery Scuttler''' is a {{Rarity|l|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished from [[Hotspots]] on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
'''Fiery Scuttler''' can be fished up from any [[Hotspot]] on the [[Crimson Isle]] after reaching {{skl|fishing|37}}.

[[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] have a {{Green|15%}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

